---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import {comparisonGroups,compareOptionsForGroup} from '../data/service-comparison.mjs';
const pathname='/comparar-solucoes/';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Comparar Onepage, sites, Landing Pages e anúncios | Imagine"
  description="Compare quando considerar Onepage, site com várias páginas, Landing Page, sites por assinatura, Google Ads e Meta Ads antes de solicitar orientação."
  pathname={pathname}
  breadcrumb={[{label:'Soluções',path:'/servicos/'},{label:'Comparar soluções',path:pathname}]}
>
  <div class="shell breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Início</a> / <a href="/servicos/">Soluções</a> / <span aria-current="page">Comparar soluções</span></div>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">Guia de escolha</p>
      <h1>Compare os formatos antes de decidir.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Uma presença institucional, uma página de campanha e uma estratégia de anúncios atendem a necessidades diferentes. Conheça o contexto de cada serviço e prepare sua conversa com a Imagine.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="cta" href="#comparacoes">Explorar as diferenças</a>
        <a class="cta cta-secondary" href="/servicos/">Ver todos os serviços</a>
      </div>
      <p id="compare-chooser-status" class="compare-chooser-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" hidden>Escolha até duas soluções para comparar lado a lado.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div id="comparacoes">
    {comparisonGroups.map((group,index)=>(
      <section class:list={['section',index%2===0?'section-soft':'']} aria-labelledby={'compare-'+group.code}>
        <div class="shell">
          <p class="kicker">Comparação de soluções</p>
          <h2 id={'compare-'+group.code}>{group.heading}</h2>
          <p class="lead">{group.introduction}</p>
          <div class="compare-grid">
            {compareOptionsForGroup(group.code).map(item=>(
              <article class="compare-card">
                <h3>{item.label}</h3>
                <dl>
                  <dt>Quando considerar</dt>
                  <dd>{item.bestFor}</dd>
                  <dt>Como costuma se organizar</dt>
                  <dd>{item.structure}</dd>
                  <dt>Pergunta para começar</dt>
                  <dd>{item.question}</dd>
                </dl>
                <button type="button" class="compare-selector" data-compare-select={item.slug}
                  aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="selected-comparison" hidden>
                  Adicionar à comparação
                </button>
                <div class="compare-links">
                  <a href={item.detailHref} aria-label={'Conhecer o serviço '+item.label}>Conhecer {item.label}</a>
                  <a href={item.contactHref} aria-label={'Conversar sobre '+item.label}>Conversar sobre {item.label}</a>
                </div>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    ))}
  </div>
  <section class="section shell selected-comparison" id="selected-comparison" aria-labelledby="selected-comparison-title" hidden>
    <h2 id="selected-comparison-title">Sua comparação de soluções</h2>
    <p>Revise os critérios das opções selecionadas. Esta comparação é informativa, não constitui proposta ou recomendação personalizada.</p>
    <ol class="compare-grid selected-comparison-list" id="selected-comparison-list"></ol>
    <p id="comparison-channel-disclosure" class="compare-contact-note" hidden>Os canais abaixo são externos ao site. A mensagem inclui somente os nomes públicos das duas soluções. Confira e confirme o envio no aplicativo escolhido; selecionar opções não envia uma solicitação.</p>
    <div class="compare-links">
      <a id="contact-comparison-whatsapp" href="/contato/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-describedby="comparison-channel-disclosure" hidden>Conversar sobre as duas opções no WhatsApp</a>
      <a id="contact-comparison-email" href="/contato/" aria-describedby="comparison-channel-disclosure" hidden>Conversar sobre as duas opções por e-mail</a>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-output-actions">
      <button type="button" id="copy-comparison-link" class="cta cta-secondary" hidden>Copiar link desta comparação</button>
      <button type="button" id="print-comparison" class="cta cta-secondary" hidden>Imprimir apenas as duas opções</button>
    </div>
    <p id="copy-comparison-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
  </section>
  <section class="section shell">
    <h2>A comparação não substitui uma proposta.</h2>
    <p class="lead">As necessidades podem combinar mais de um serviço. O escopo contratado, as etapas, a mensalidade, o investimento em anúncios e eventuais integrações só podem ser confirmados na proposta oficial e nos documentos aplicáveis.</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="cta" href="/contato/">Conversar com a Imagine</a>
      <a class="cta cta-secondary" href="/conteudos/landing-page-ou-site/">Ler o guia Landing Page ou site</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script>
    import {comparisonOptions} from '../data/service-comparison.mjs';
    import {composeReviewedComparisonContact} from '../data/comparison-contact.mjs';
    import {contactWhatsAppUrl,contactEmailUrl} from '../data/contact-channels.mjs';
    import {encodeReviewedComparisonFragment,decodeReviewedComparisonFragment}
      from '../data/reviewed-comparison-fragment.mjs';
    // F174: deliberate, transient shortlist of at most two curated services.
    // No visitor profile, free text, network, browser storage or URL changes.
    const buttons=[...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-compare-select]')];
    const selectedSection=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#selected-comparison');
    const selectedList=document.querySelector<HTMLOListElement>('#selected-comparison-list');
    const status=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#compare-chooser-status');
    const share=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#copy-comparison-link');
    const print=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#print-comparison');
    const shareStatus=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#copy-comparison-status');
    const pairWhatsApp=document.querySelector<HTMLAnchorElement>('#contact-comparison-whatsapp');
    const pairEmail=document.querySelector<HTMLAnchorElement>('#contact-comparison-email');
    const pairDisclosure=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#comparison-channel-disclosure');
    const catalog=new Map(comparisonOptions.map(item=>[item.slug,item]));
    if(selectedSection&&selectedList&&status&&share&&print&&shareStatus&&pairWhatsApp&&pairEmail&&pairDisclosure&&buttons.length===catalog.size){
      const selected=new Set<string>();
      let revision=0;
      let copyPending=false;
      const render=()=>{
        revision++;
        shareStatus.textContent='';
        share.hidden=selected.size!==2||!navigator.clipboard?.writeText;
        print.hidden=selected.size!==2||typeof window.print!=='function';
        share.disabled=copyPending;
        const cards=[...selected].map(slug=>catalog.get(slug)).filter(item=>item!==undefined);
        selectedList.replaceChildren();
        for(const item of cards){
          const li=document.createElement('li');
          li.className='compare-card';
          const heading=document.createElement('h3');
          heading.textContent=item.label;
          const list=document.createElement('dl');
          for(const [title,detail] of [
            ['Quando considerar',item.bestFor],
            ['Como costuma se organizar',item.structure],
            ['Pergunta para começar',item.question]
          ]){
            const term=document.createElement('dt');
            const definition=document.createElement('dd');
            term.textContent=title;
            definition.textContent=detail;
            list.append(term,definition);
          }
          const links=document.createElement('div');
          links.className='compare-links';
          const detail=document.createElement('a');
          detail.href=item.detailHref;
          detail.textContent='Conhecer '+item.label;
          const contact=document.createElement('a');
          contact.href=item.contactHref;
          contact.textContent='Conversar sobre '+item.label;
          links.append(detail,contact);
          li.append(heading,list,links);
          selectedList.append(li);
        }
        // F188: no browser POST: the visitor initiates a curated external link.
        const pairReady=cards.length===2;
        pairWhatsApp.hidden=!pairReady;
        pairEmail.hidden=!pairReady;
        pairDisclosure.hidden=!pairReady;
        if(pairReady){
          const text=composeReviewedComparisonContact([...selected]);
          pairWhatsApp.href=contactWhatsAppUrl(text.message);
          pairEmail.href=contactEmailUrl(text.subject,text.message);
        }else{
          pairWhatsApp.removeAttribute('href');
          pairEmail.removeAttribute('href');
        }
        selectedSection.hidden=cards.length===0;
        status.textContent=cards.length===0
          ?'Escolha até duas soluções para comparar lado a lado.'
          :cards.length===1
            ?'1 solução selecionada. Escolha mais uma ou desmarque a atual.'
            :'2 soluções selecionadas. Desmarque uma para escolher outra.';
        for(const button of buttons){
          const slug=button.dataset.compareSelect??'';
          const active=selected.has(slug);
          button.disabled=!active&&selected.size===2;
          button.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(active));
          button.textContent=active?'Remover da comparação':'Adicionar à comparação';
        }
      };
      for(const button of buttons){
        if(!catalog.has(button.dataset.compareSelect??''))continue;
        button.hidden=false;
        button.addEventListener('click',()=>{
          const slug=button.dataset.compareSelect??'';
          if(selected.has(slug))selected.delete(slug);
          else if(selected.size<2&&catalog.has(slug))selected.add(slug);
          const fragment=selected.size===2
            ?encodeReviewedComparisonFragment([...selected]):'';
          // Replace rather than push: no visitor history trail of choices.
          window.history.replaceState(null,'',
            window.location.pathname+window.location.search+fragment);
          render();
        });
      }
      // F203: explicit visitor print, with no persisted or submitted data.
      print.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(selected.size===2)window.print();});
      share.addEventListener('click',async()=>{
        if(copyPending||selected.size!==2)return;
        const fragment=encodeReviewedComparisonFragment([...selected]);
        // Copy only a fixed public route and two approved service IDs.
        // Never copy arbitrary query strings from the current page.
        const value=window.location.origin+'/comparar-solucoes/'+fragment;
        const ticket=++revision;
        copyPending=true;
        share.disabled=true;
        shareStatus.textContent='';
        try{
          if(!navigator.clipboard?.writeText)throw Error('clipboard unavailable');
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(value);
          if(ticket===revision)
            shareStatus.textContent='Link da comparação copiado. Compartilhe somente se desejar.';
        }catch{
          if(ticket===revision)
            shareStatus.textContent='Não foi possível copiar automaticamente. Você pode explorar os serviços acima.';
        }finally{
          copyPending=false;
          share.disabled=false;
        }
      });
      const applyFragment=()=>{
        const pair=decodeReviewedComparisonFragment(window.location.hash);
        selected.clear();
        if(pair)for(const slug of pair)selected.add(slug);
        render();
      };
      window.addEventListener('hashchange',applyFragment);
      window.addEventListener('popstate',applyFragment);
      status.hidden=false;
      applyFragment();
    }
  </script>
  <style>
    #contact-comparison-whatsapp[hidden],#contact-comparison-email[hidden],
    #comparison-channel-disclosure[hidden]{display:none!important}
    .compare-contact-note{max-width:730px;color:#405571;margin:22px 0 0}
    .compare-output-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}
    .compare-output-actions button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer}
    #print-comparison[hidden],#copy-comparison-link[hidden]{display:none!important}
    #copy-comparison-link{margin-top:18px}
    #copy-comparison-link:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:wait}
    #copy-comparison-status{color:#405571;margin-top:14px}
    #copy-comparison-status:empty{display:none}
    .compare-selector{font:inherit;font-weight:750;color:#124b81;background:#f4f8fd;border:1px solid #97b1cd;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;min-height:44px;cursor:pointer;margin-top:20px;text-align:left}
    .compare-selector[aria-pressed="true"]{color:#14583d;background:#e6f5ec;border-color:#287c5b}
    .compare-selector[disabled]{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}
    .compare-selector[hidden],.compare-chooser-status[hidden],.selected-comparison[hidden]{display:none!important}
    .compare-selector:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #145d9d;outline-offset:3px}
    .compare-chooser-status{color:#415873;margin-top:18px}
    .selected-comparison{scroll-margin-top:20px}
    .selected-comparison-list{list-style:none;padding:0}
    .compare-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,250px),1fr));gap:18px;margin-top:32px}
    .compare-card{background:white;color:#182438;border:1px solid #dce6f2;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(20px,2.4vw,30px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0}
    .compare-card h3{margin:0 0 20px}
    .compare-card dl{margin:0;flex:1}
    .compare-card dt{font-size:.89rem;color:#195f9a;font-weight:800;margin-top:15px}
    .compare-card dt:first-child{margin-top:0}
    .compare-card dd{margin:5px 0 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
    .compare-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 20px;margin-top:24px}
    .compare-links a{font-weight:750;color:#0b5ea9;text-underline-offset:4px}
    #comparacoes{scroll-margin-top:20px}
    @media(max-width:480px){.compare-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.compare-card{padding:22px}}
    /* A printed pair includes only the two selected cards, not the
       complete service directory or controls for external channels. */
    @media print{
      :global(header),:global(footer),:global(.skip-link){display:none!important}
      :global(main#conteudo > :not(#selected-comparison)){display:none!important}
      :global(main#conteudo > #selected-comparison){display:block!important}
      .selected-comparison{padding:0!important;width:100%;max-width:none}
      .selected-comparison-list{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
      .selected-comparison-list .compare-card{break-inside:avoid;border-color:#7b8b9e}
      .selected-comparison-list .compare-links{display:none!important}
      .compare-output-actions,.compare-contact-note,#copy-comparison-status,
      #contact-comparison-whatsapp,#contact-comparison-email{display:none!important}
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
